{"text": "From: Nathalie Tremblay-Singh <nathalie@prairieledger.example>\nTo: Bohdan Kravchuk <bohdan@kravchukelectric.example>\nCc: halyna.k@kravchukelectric.example\nDate: Mon, 16 Feb 2026 08:47:03 -0600\nSubject: T4s for 2025 - three problems before I can file\n\nHi Bohdan,\n\nI'm ready to file the 2025 T4s for Kravchuk Electric Ltd. (payroll account 72114 8830 RP0001) but three things are stopping me. They are due at the end of February, so I need answers this week please.\n\n1. Sasha. The SIN I have for Oleksandr Petrenko is 935 589 010. A SIN that starts with 9 is temporary and has an expiry date. His file says the work permit expires June 30, 2026, but I have no copy of the permit and nothing showing the SIN is still valid. Can you get a photo of both from him? Gross for the year was $58,214.60, so this is not a small slip.\n\n2. Jean-Luc Fontaine. He started 2025-09-08 and I was never given a SIN at all, just \"will bring it Monday\" on the TD1. I cannot file his slip without one. He was paid C$19,877.25. His cell is 204-555-0148 if Halyna wants to chase him.\n\n3. Destiny Moose-Flett. She gave you a letter in October saying she is a registered Status Indian and that part of her work was on reserve at Peguis. If that is right, some of her pay is exempt under section 87 and goes in box 71 instead of box 14, and we over-deducted tax from about $11,400 of it. I need the dates and the job site address to split it properly. Please do not guess. Destiny knows which weeks they were.\n\nAlso, for the record, the SINs I do have on file and will use: Halyna Kravchuk 652-040-619, you 273682658.\n\nLast thing. I tried to log in to CRA My Business Account to check the PD7A balance and the password you gave me no longer works (user ID kravchukelec1, password Volts&Amps2024). If you changed it, please do NOT email me the new one. Phone me at 204.555.0113 or come by: 887 Pembina Hwy, Unit 6, Winnipeg, MB R3M 2M3.\n\nDecember's remittance of $4,318.09 did go through from the Assiniboine Credit Co-operative account on Jan 15, so at least that part is fine.\n\nThanks,\nNathalie\n\nPrairie Ledger Bookkeeping Inc.", "kind": "Email", "detail": "374 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Nathalie Tremblay-Singh", "Bohdan Kravchuk", "halyna.k", "Oleksandr Petrenko", "Jean-Luc Fontaine", "Destiny Moose-Flett", "Halyna Kravchuk", "Nathalie"], "companies": ["Prairieledger", "Kravchuk Electric Ltd.", "Assiniboine Credit Co-operative", "Prairie Ledger Bookkeeping Inc."]}, "topics": {"places": ["Winnipeg", "Peguis", "Assiniboine Credit Co-operative"], "health": ["status Indian"], "sensitive": ["SIN", "work permit", "registered Status Indian"], "names": ["Oleksandr Petrenko", "Jean-Luc Fontaine", "Destiny Moose-Flett", "Halyna Kravchuk", "Bohdan Kravchuk", "Nathalie"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.6999999992549419, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 24597.099999997765, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 6, "end": 29, "text": "Nathalie Tremblay-Singh", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Nathalie Tremblay-Singh"}, {"start": 31, "end": 61, "text": "nathalie@prairieledger.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "nathalie@prairieledger.example"}, {"start": 67, "end": 82, "text": "Bohdan Kravchuk", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Bohdan Kravchuk"}, {"start": 84, "end": 115, "text": "bohdan@kravchukelectric.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "bohdan@kravchukelectric.example"}, {"start": 121, "end": 154, "text": "halyna.k@kravchukelectric.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "halyna.k@kravchukelectric.example"}, {"start": 161, "en